# armour/shared/pauldron_flared6_r: the legend FLARED pauldron on the right shoulder (flared.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a flared guard grown great: the plate sweeps up and out into one lit point 3 (legend 4) px over the shoulder top,
# a dark seam and a lame under it (the TALL mass; never near the face, under the ear row).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the lame's lip, G the point's glint, N the seam, P the lit plate and point.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron flared.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

